##Notes##
// Profil OpenPPL d'exemple : push / fold. Tapis avec les mains de la liste, sinon fold.

##listPush##
AA KK QQ JJ TT 99 88 77 66 55 44 AKs AQs AJs ATs A9s A8s A7s A5s KQs KJs KTs QJs JTs AKo AQo AJo ATo KQo

##f$preflop##
WHEN StackSize <= 12 AND islistPush RaiseMax FORCE
WHEN Raises = 0 AND islistPush RaiseTo 2.2 FORCE
WHEN Raises >= 1 AND ($AA OR $KK OR $QQ OR $AK) RaiseMax FORCE
WHEN Raises = 0 AND InBigBlind Check FORCE
WHEN Others Fold FORCE

##f$flop##
WHEN prwin > 0.65 RaiseMax FORCE
WHEN prwin > 0.45 Call FORCE
WHEN Others Check FORCE

##f$turn##
WHEN prwin > 0.65 RaiseMax FORCE
WHEN prwin > 0.50 Call FORCE
WHEN Others Check FORCE

##f$river##
WHEN prwin > 0.70 RaiseMax FORCE
WHEN prwin > 0.55 Call FORCE
WHEN Others Check FORCE
